{
  "slug": "codebase-audit",
  "name": "Codebase Audit",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Produces a thorough, evidence-based software quality assessment of any git repository. Grades 16 dimensions — architecture, security, database design, observability, testing, disaster recovery, GDPR, dependencies, frontend bundle, and CI/CD speed — with file:line citations so every finding is verifiable in under a minute. Works on any language (Python, TypeScript, Go, Rust, Java, Ruby, PHP, C#, etc.).",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `report` (Produce a thorough software quality assessment report for a git repository — covering code architecture, security, database design,…).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install codebase-audit@claude-community` from `aimfeld/claude-plugins` (`plugins/codebase-audit`).",
